//   Redbubble device labels look swapped Aug 3 to 18 (same upstream tagging issue as Strong). Redbubble at score >=30 still carries heavy bot traffic in Direct and desktop,
//   so Redbubble CVR sits far below Strong and Maximum; read direction, not level.
//   TeePublic last-year data starts 2025-09-01, after the Cloudflare score began (about Aug 22, 2025), so the whole tpLY range has the score.
